# OPUS-TYPED-BINDING-20260930-20, next_core_tasks.md §3 item 207: in a method `Model: b c` with b absent and c a Model declares b
# bound to c's descriptor -- no merge, no copy: a write through b is read through c.  Entry 7.
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

Other:
    int: p 1
    int: q 2
end: Other

fn: m () int
    int: out 0
    Model: c
    c\value: 5U
    Model: b c
    b\value: 9U
    if: c\value = 9U
        out: 7
    return: out
end: m

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
